Letter to Eremo, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Letter%20to%20Markwin\">Letter to Markwin</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Secret%20Letter\">Secret Letter</a>.\n</p><p>Contains a <a href=\"#/wiki/Letter%20from%20the%20Wizards\">letter</a>, and either a <a href=\"#/wiki/Strange%20Yellow%20Powder\">yellow</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Strange%20Red%20Powder\">red</a>, or <a href=\"#/wiki/Strange%20Blue%20Powder\">blue powder</a> needed for the world event <a href=\"#/quest/the-colours-of-magic\">The Colours of Magic</a>. The envelopes will become unusable when a wizard is chosen, and will finally disappear a week after the event. The following creatures are known to drop it, but only while the event is active:\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Azure%20Frog\">Azure Frog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Badger\">Badger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Djinn\">Blue Djinn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dawn%20Bat\">Dawn Bat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Guard\">Deepling Guard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Scout\">Deepling Scout</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Spellsinger\">Deepling Spellsinger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Worker\">Deepling Worker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\">Dragon Lord Hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Bonelord\">Elder Bonelord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a